---
source: crates/vitrify-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "long_help(&cmd, &path)"
---
External contracts: one SDD's pins on another's contracts, and its transcriptions

Usage: vitrify pin <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list  List every external contract with its authority and state
  sync  Rewrite stale pins from their authorities (working tree only); print the units whose trace that moved
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

Subcommands: list (every external contract, its kind and state) · sync (rewrite stale pins'
         hashes)
Exit status: 2 without a subcommand; see each subcommand's --help
Examples:
  vitrify pin list --all
  vitrify pin sync --sdd specs/beta
